msgstr "Esc avbryter · Backspace inaktiverar genvägen"

#: src/anduinos_whisper_gtk/app.py:445
#, python-format
msgid "Download %s from Hugging Face?"
msgstr "Ladda ner %s från Hugging Face?"

#: src/anduinos_whisper_gtk/app.py:447
msgid ""
"This optional model is hosted by Hugging Face, a third-party service. AnduinOS is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or partnered with Hugging Face.\n"
"\n"
"If you continue, your computer will connect directly to huggingface.co. Hugging Face will receive your public IP address and that address may reveal your approximate location.\n"
"\n"
"Privacy policy: https://huggingface.co/privacy"
msgstr ""
"Den här valfria modellen lagras hos Hugging Face, en tredjepartstjänst. AnduinOS är inte knutet till eller sponsrat av Hugging Face och har inget partnerskap med tjänsten.\n"
"\n"
"Om du fortsätter ansluter din dator direkt till huggingface.co. Hugging Face får då din offentliga IP-adress, som kan avslöja din ungefärliga plats.\n"
"\n"
"Integritetspolicy: https://huggingface.co/privacy"

